{
  "story_id": "hand-of-the-potter",
  "chapter": 3,
  "total_duration_ms": 327384,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "On Rafael's last day, Avôlo brought out something Rafael had never seen before.",
      "start_ms": 2293,
      "end_ms": 7388
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "It was a very small dark clay bowl, maybe seven centimeters wide.",
      "start_ms": 7388,
      "end_ms": 11592
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "It was slightly crooked.",
      "start_ms": 11592,
      "end_ms": 13185
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The walls were uneven.",
      "start_ms": 13185,
      "end_ms": 14650
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Its glaze was a very old dark green that had faded in places.",
      "start_ms": 14650,
      "end_ms": 18599
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Avôlo held it in both hands.",
      "start_ms": 18599,
      "end_ms": 20446
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "He said, \"This is the bowl I made when I was ten.",
      "start_ms": 20446,
      "end_ms": 23630
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "When my mother died.",
      "start_ms": 23630,
      "end_ms": 24968
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I told you about it.",
      "start_ms": 24968,
      "end_ms": 26306
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "This is that bowl.\" Rafael took it very carefully.",
      "start_ms": 26306,
      "end_ms": 29554
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "It was so light.",
      "start_ms": 29554,
      "end_ms": 30637
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "It had the same shape as his own first bowl, more or less.",
      "start_ms": 30637,
      "end_ms": 34395
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "He was moved without knowing exactly why.",
      "start_ms": 34395,
      "end_ms": 37134
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "\"I want you to take one of your bowls home,\" said Avôlo.",
      "start_ms": 37134,
      "end_ms": 40764
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "\"Any one.",
      "start_ms": 40764,
      "end_ms": 41401
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Your favorite.",
      "start_ms": 41401,
      "end_ms": 42356
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Keep it.",
      "start_ms": 42356,
      "end_ms": 42930
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Put it somewhere you will see it every day.",
      "start_ms": 42930,
      "end_ms": 45732
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "In fifty years, when I am gone and you are old, you will hold it and you will remember.",
      "start_ms": 45732,
      "end_ms": 51337
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "That is how this works.\" Rafael picked the smallest of his three bowls.",
      "start_ms": 51337,
      "end_ms": 55923
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "It was slightly lopsided, but he had liked it best when he made it.",
      "start_ms": 55923,
      "end_ms": 60254
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "\"I will take this one,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 60254,
      "end_ms": 62420
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Avôlo took down a small carved wooden box from the top shelf.",
      "start_ms": 62420,
      "end_ms": 66369
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Inside was another very small bowl — a fresh one, unglazed, unfired.",
      "start_ms": 66369,
      "end_ms": 70764
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "He set it on the workbench.",
      "start_ms": 70764,
      "end_ms": 72547
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "He said, \"And this one I want you to help me finish.",
      "start_ms": 72547,
      "end_ms": 75923
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "I made this last week — I threw it on the wheel while you were watching me.",
      "start_ms": 75923,
      "end_ms": 80764
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "I want you to glaze it.",
      "start_ms": 80764,
      "end_ms": 82292
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Then we will fire it.",
      "start_ms": 82292,
      "end_ms": 83694
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "And then — this one stays with me.",
      "start_ms": 83694,
      "end_ms": 85923
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "On my table.",
      "start_ms": 85923,
      "end_ms": 86751
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "So that every day I eat, I will look at it, and I will think of you.\"",
      "start_ms": 86751,
      "end_ms": 91273
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Rafael did not know what to say.",
      "start_ms": 91273,
      "end_ms": 93375
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "He said, quietly, \"But I have not learned to glaze yet.\" Avôlo smiled.",
      "start_ms": 93375,
      "end_ms": 97897
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "He said, \"Then I will teach you now.",
      "start_ms": 97897,
      "end_ms": 100254
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "It is not hard.",
      "start_ms": 100254,
      "end_ms": 101273
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "It is another thing that is mostly listening.",
      "start_ms": 101273,
      "end_ms": 104203
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "You will do it.",
      "start_ms": 104203,
      "end_ms": 105222
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "You do not need to be perfect.",
      "start_ms": 105222,
      "end_ms": 107197
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "This is the bowl you and I made together.",
      "start_ms": 107197,
      "end_ms": 109872
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "If it is a little imperfect, that is exactly right.\"",
      "start_ms": 109872,
      "end_ms": 113184
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Avôlo showed him how to glaze.",
      "start_ms": 113184,
      "end_ms": 115455
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "There were two things to decide, he said — the color, and how the color was applied.",
      "start_ms": 115455,
      "end_ms": 121680
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Rafael chose a pale blue-green that Avôlo had made himself from local minerals.",
      "start_ms": 121680,
      "end_ms": 127540
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Rafael dipped the bowl carefully into the glaze bucket.",
      "start_ms": 127540,
      "end_ms": 131641
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "He turned it.",
      "start_ms": 131641,
      "end_ms": 132667
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "He let the extra glaze drip off.",
      "start_ms": 132667,
      "end_ms": 135084
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "He set it down.",
      "start_ms": 135084,
      "end_ms": 136256
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "On the outside he used a small brush to add a thin dark rim near the top.",
      "start_ms": 136256,
      "end_ms": 141676
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "That was a small choice he made.",
      "start_ms": 141676,
      "end_ms": 144093
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Avôlo watched him make it.",
      "start_ms": 144093,
      "end_ms": 146070
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Avôlo did not stop him.",
      "start_ms": 146070,
      "end_ms": 147828
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "When Rafael was done, the bowl was — Rafael thought — plain but not ugly.",
      "start_ms": 147828,
      "end_ms": 153248
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Simple.",
      "start_ms": 153248,
      "end_ms": 153834
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Honest.",
      "start_ms": 153834,
      "end_ms": 154493
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "They fired it that afternoon.",
      "start_ms": 154493,
      "end_ms": 156691
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "It was a small firing — only the one bowl, plus a few small things Avôlo had ready.",
      "start_ms": 156691,
      "end_ms": 162843
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Rafael tended the fire.",
      "start_ms": 162843,
      "end_ms": 164601
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "When it was cool, in the morning, they took it out.",
      "start_ms": 164601,
      "end_ms": 168410
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "The glaze had come out beautifully — a soft blue-green that looked like a pond.",
      "start_ms": 168410,
      "end_ms": 174269
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "The dark rim held it.",
      "start_ms": 174269,
      "end_ms": 175881
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Rafael handed it to Avôlo.",
      "start_ms": 175881,
      "end_ms": 177858
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Avôlo held it in both hands.",
      "start_ms": 177858,
      "end_ms": 179982
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "He said, \"Rafael.",
      "start_ms": 179982,
      "end_ms": 181301
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "This is a beautiful bowl.",
      "start_ms": 181301,
      "end_ms": 183205
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Genuinely.",
      "start_ms": 183205,
      "end_ms": 184011
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Not because you are ten and I am your grandfather.",
      "start_ms": 184011,
      "end_ms": 187746
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "It is a real bowl.",
      "start_ms": 187746,
      "end_ms": 189138
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "It will hold soup very well.",
      "start_ms": 189138,
      "end_ms": 191262
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "I will use it every day.\"",
      "start_ms": 191262,
      "end_ms": 193239
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "\"Avôlo,\" said Rafael.",
      "start_ms": 193239,
      "end_ms": 194851
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "\"Can I ask you something else.\" \"Yes.\" \"Would you — could you — teach me every summer.",
      "start_ms": 194851,
      "end_ms": 201223
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Not just this once.",
      "start_ms": 201223,
      "end_ms": 202688
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Every summer that I come.",
      "start_ms": 202688,
      "end_ms": 204592
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Until I am — until I am too old to come.\" Avôlo looked at him for a long moment.",
      "start_ms": 204592,
      "end_ms": 210525
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "He said, \"Rafael.",
      "start_ms": 210525,
      "end_ms": 211843
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "That would make me very happy.",
      "start_ms": 211843,
      "end_ms": 214114
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "But there is something you should know.",
      "start_ms": 214114,
      "end_ms": 217044
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "I am seventy-four.",
      "start_ms": 217044,
      "end_ms": 218435
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "I might not be here in ten years.",
      "start_ms": 218435,
      "end_ms": 220925
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "I might not be here in five years.",
      "start_ms": 220925,
      "end_ms": 223489
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "So — yes.",
      "start_ms": 223489,
      "end_ms": 224221
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Every summer for as long as I am here.",
      "start_ms": 224221,
      "end_ms": 227078
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "I promise.",
      "start_ms": 227078,
      "end_ms": 227884
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "But after that — after that — you have to keep doing it.",
      "start_ms": 227884,
      "end_ms": 232058
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Somewhere.",
      "start_ms": 232058,
      "end_ms": 232864
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "With someone else.",
      "start_ms": 232864,
      "end_ms": 234256
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Or by yourself.",
      "start_ms": 234256,
      "end_ms": 235428
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Do not stop.",
      "start_ms": 235428,
      "end_ms": 236380
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "You are becoming a potter.",
      "start_ms": 236380,
      "end_ms": 238357
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "That is a small quiet gift.",
      "start_ms": 238357,
      "end_ms": 240408
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Do not put it down.\"",
      "start_ms": 240408,
      "end_ms": 242020
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "\"I promise,\" said Rafael.",
      "start_ms": 242020,
      "end_ms": 243924
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "\"That is enough,\" said Avôlo.",
      "start_ms": 243924,
      "end_ms": 246048
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Rafael went home with his small lopsided bowl wrapped in a piece of soft cloth.",
      "start_ms": 246048,
      "end_ms": 250843
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "His mother met him at the train station in Barcelona.",
      "start_ms": 250843,
      "end_ms": 254080
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "She saw the small bowl.",
      "start_ms": 254080,
      "end_ms": 255518
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "She asked what it was.",
      "start_ms": 255518,
      "end_ms": 256897
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Rafael said, \"I made it.",
      "start_ms": 256897,
      "end_ms": 258395
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "At Avôlo's.",
      "start_ms": 258395,
      "end_ms": 259115
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "He taught me.\" His mother did not say anything for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 259115,
      "end_ms": 262771
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Then she said, quietly, \"Oh, Rafael.",
      "start_ms": 262771,
      "end_ms": 264988
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "That is — that is wonderful.\" She was tearing up.",
      "start_ms": 264988,
      "end_ms": 267985
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Rafael did not know why.",
      "start_ms": 267985,
      "end_ms": 269484
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "He hugged her.",
      "start_ms": 269484,
      "end_ms": 270443
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "He put the bowl on his bedside table when he got home.",
      "start_ms": 270443,
      "end_ms": 273739
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "He looked at it every night before he went to sleep.",
      "start_ms": 273739,
      "end_ms": 276916
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "He looked at it every morning when he woke up.",
      "start_ms": 276916,
      "end_ms": 279733
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Every summer he went back to Ourense.",
      "start_ms": 279733,
      "end_ms": 282011
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Every summer he learned more.",
      "start_ms": 282011,
      "end_ms": 283809
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "When he was twelve, he made a bowl that Avôlo said was as good as one of his own.",
      "start_ms": 283809,
      "end_ms": 288724
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "When he was fifteen, he made a small vase that Avôlo said might be better than his own.",
      "start_ms": 288724,
      "end_ms": 293998
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Avôlo lived until Rafael was seventeen.",
      "start_ms": 293998,
      "end_ms": 296396
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "On the day Avôlo died, Rafael was at university in Madrid.",
      "start_ms": 296396,
      "end_ms": 299932
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "He went home.",
      "start_ms": 299932,
      "end_ms": 300771
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "He took the small blue-green bowl he had made when he was ten from Avôlo's kitchen.",
      "start_ms": 300771,
      "end_ms": 305806
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He kept it beside his own first bowl.",
      "start_ms": 305806,
      "end_ms": 308084
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "And every summer for the rest of his life, though Avôlo was gone, he went back to Ourense — to the small stone workshop — and he made bowls.",
      "start_ms": 308084,
      "end_ms": 316535
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "He never became famous.",
      "start_ms": 316535,
      "end_ms": 317974
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "He made about two hundred bowls a year.",
      "start_ms": 317974,
      "end_ms": 320371
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "All of them went to people in Ourense and Barcelona who needed bowls.",
      "start_ms": 320371,
      "end_ms": 324567
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "And every bowl held something.",
      "start_ms": 324567,
      "end_ms": 326425
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "That was enough.",
      "start_ms": 326425,
      "end_ms": 327384
    }
  ]
}